== Trivia ==
*'''Chester''' has no dialogue unless having purchased [[Dackinoru]]'s tip. After talking to them, they will no longer give dialogue.
*'''Chester''' does, however, display text above their head, as if communicating with the other [[NPC]]s in the {{zone|Shifted Tavern}}.
*The name and design of '''Chester''' was created by Planet Minecraft user Squirrel.

